@courseId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000


### 1. Login
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{ModeratorEmail}}",
  "password": "{{DefaultPassword}}"
}


### ─── Courses ─── read ✅ 200 | create/update/delete/publish ❌ 403

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/courses/read
###
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/courses/create
###
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/courses/update
###
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/courses/delete
###
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/courses/publish


