GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/users/read
###
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/users/update
###
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/users/delete


### ─── Categories ─── read ✅ 200 | create/update/delete ❌ 403 ──────

GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/categories/read
###
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/test/categories/create
